## 7. Motion & Animation System

### 7.1 Core Principles

1. **Physics-based** — Motion follows natural deceleration curves, never linear.
2. **Purposeful** — Every animation communicates state change, not decoration.
3. **Fast** — Micro-interactions: 120–200ms. Component transitions: 250–350ms. Page transitions: 400ms.
4. **Respectful** — All animations honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

```css
/* Easing tokens */
--ease-out:      cubic-bezier(0.0, 0, 0.2, 1);   /* Most UI transitions */
--ease-in:       cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1);      /* Dismiss/exit only */
--ease-in-out:   cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);   /* Balanced movement */
--ease-spring:   cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275); /* Bouncy reveals */
--ease-smooth:   cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);    /* Silky scrolls */

/* Duration tokens */
--duration-instant: 80ms;
--duration-fast:    150ms;
--duration-base:    250ms;
--duration-slow:    350ms;
--duration-slower:  500ms;
--duration-page:    400ms;
```

### 7.2 Motion Catalogue

**Landing Page:**

| Trigger | Element | Animation | Duration | Easing |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Page load | Hero headline | Fade up (y: 24px → 0) + opacity (0 → 1) | 600ms | `ease-out` |
| Page load | Hero subheadline | Same, staggered +120ms | 600ms | `ease-out` |
| Page load | CTA button | Scale (0.96 → 1) + opacity | 400ms | `ease-spring` |
| Page load | Hero image | Fade in (0 → 1) right-to-left reveal via clip-path | 800ms | `ease-out` |
| Scroll | Stat counters | Animated count-up from 0 when in view | 1200ms | `ease-out` |
| Scroll | Feature cards | Cascade fade-up (stagger 80ms per card) | 500ms | `ease-out` |
| Scroll | Certificate preview | Parallax float (y shifts slower than scroll) | Continuous | — |
| Hover | CTA button | Background ripple + subtle scale (1 → 1.02) + gold glow shadow | 200ms | `ease-out` |
| Hover | Feature cards | y: 0 → -4px + shadow intensify | 200ms | `ease-out` |
| Hover | Nav links | Gold underline slides in from left (width: 0 → 100%) | 200ms | `ease-out` |

**Registration & OTP:**

| Trigger | Element | Animation | Duration |
|---|---|---|---|
| Form open | Modal | Scale (0.95 → 1) + opacity + backdrop blur-in | 300ms |
| Input focus | Field border | Color transition to `--color-gold` + subtle label lift | 150ms |
| OTP input | Each digit cell | Scale pop (1 → 1.1 → 1) when digit entered | 120ms |
| OTP success | All cells | Green fill ripple left-to-right (stagger 60ms) | 360ms |
| OTP error | All cells | Horizontal shake (±4px, 3 cycles) | 300ms |
| Form submit | Button | Content swaps to spinner; button width locks | 150ms |

**Generation Loader:**

| Element | Animation | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Progress bar fill | Smooth width transition driven by polling data | Eased, never jumps |
| Thread status dots (5) | Fade in + pulse ring when thread is active | Each dot activates in sequence |
| Thread completion | dot: pulse → solid green checkmark scale-in | Per thread |
| "Audit Wisdom" tip card | Crossfade (fade out old, fade in new) every 8s | Text swap, not slide |
| "Enter Exam" button reveal | Scale (0.9 → 1) + gold glow + subtle bounce | Post-generation |

**Exam Interface:**

| Element | Animation | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Question card enter | Slide in from right (x: 30px → 0) + opacity | 250ms, direction reverses on auto-advance |
| Question card exit | Slide out left (x: 0 → -30px) + opacity fade | Simultaneous with enter |
| Option select | Immediate: background fill sweeps left-to-right | 150ms — fast, deliberate feel |
| Option lock | Selection fades to locked gold, others fade to disabled grey | 150ms |
| Per-question timer ring | SVG stroke-dashoffset countdown animation | Continuous, synchronized to Redis |
| Timer warning (≤5s) | Ring color: gold → orange → red (step transitions) | State-based, not animated |
| Timer at 0 | Ring pulses 3× red + question fades out | 300ms |
| Global timer <60s | Timer text color shifts to `--color-error`, gentle pulse | CSS animation |
| Tab violation toast | Slide in from top (y: -60px → 0) + shake on 2nd | 300ms |
| Auto-submit | Question dims, "Submitting exam..." overlay fades in | 400ms |

**Results Page:**

| Element | Animation | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Verdict reveal | Score number counts up from 0 to final value | 1500ms, ease-out |
| Pass/Fail badge | Scale (0.5 → 1.05 → 1.0) + opacity | 400ms, ease-spring |
| Radar chart | Each axis draws out from center sequentially | 800ms total, staggered |
| Correct answer indicator | Green checkmark draws (SVG stroke-dashoffset) | 200ms per item, as user scrolls |
| Incorrect answer indicator | Red X draws | 200ms |
| Certificate reveal | Fold-unfold motion (scaleY: 0 → 1 from center) + shadow | 600ms |

**Certificate Download Button:**

| State | Animation |
|---|---|
| Idle | Subtle gold shimmer sweep across button (4s loop) |
| Hover | Background gradient shifts + scale 1 → 1.02 + shadow |
| Click | Brief scale press (1 → 0.97) + download icon spins 180° |

