## 8. Image & Visual Strategy

### 8.1 Photography Direction

All photography uses **Unsplash / Pexels** (CC0 licensed) with a consistent art direction:

**Landing page — hero section:**
- Scene: Modern open-plan corporate office, floor-to-ceiling windows, overcast natural light
- Subject: Person at a laptop, slightly blurred, white desk, minimal clutter
- Color treatment: Desaturate 20%, slightly cool white balance → harmonizes with white/black palette
- Overlay: Soft white gradient from left edge (to ensure hero text legibility)

**Recommended search terms:** `"professional workspace white desk"`, `"corporate audit meeting"`, `"cybersecurity professional office"`

**Trust / Social proof section:**
- Headshots (avatars) of 3–4 fictional testimonials: professional, diverse, corporate attire
- Cropped circular, 80×80px, with thin gold ring border

**Certificate preview:**
- Actual generated certificate JPEG displayed in the feature section (populated with a demo entry)
- Displayed at a slight 2° clockwise tilt, with a realistic drop shadow underneath

### 8.2 Illustration & Graphics

**Hero graphic (right side of landing hero):**
- Abstract representation of a shield composed of fine grid lines / circuit traces
- Black lines on a white background, with select nodes highlighted in gold
- Conveys: security, precision, intelligence
- File: SVG (animated — lines draw in on page load via `stroke-dashoffset` animation)

**Track selection cards (dashboard):**
- Associate Track: Illustrated as stacked document pages / checklist icon in black + gold
- Professional Track: Illustrated as a magnifying glass over a process flowchart

**Empty state illustrations:**
- "No attempts yet" on dashboard: Light line-art illustration of an open exam booklet

**Loading states:**
- 5-thread generation dots: minimalist SVG animated circles (see Section 7.2)

