## 11. Responsive Breakpoints

```css
/* Mobile-first */
--bp-sm:  640px;   /* Small devices */
--bp-md:  768px;   /* Tablets */
--bp-lg:  1024px;  /* Laptops */
--bp-xl:  1280px;  /* Desktops */
--bp-2xl: 1536px;  /* Large monitors */
```

**per-page responsive rules:**

| Screen | Landing Hero | Stats | Tracks | Dashboard | Exam |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Mobile (<768) | Single col, image hidden | 2×2 grid | Stacked cards | No sidebar: bottom nav | Full-screen question, timer top-right |
| Tablet (768–1024) | Split 50/50, image shown | 4-col row | Side-by-side | Collapsible sidebar | Same as mobile |
| Desktop (>1024) | Split 55/45 | 4-col row | Side-by-side with hover | Fixed sidebar | Max-width 760px, centered |

**Exam on mobile — critical spec:**
- Question card: full-width, no padding margin beyond 16px.
- Option buttons: full-width, 60px tall minimum (touch target).
- Per-question timer: top-right corner, 48px ring.
- Global timer: always visible in a sticky top bar.
- Anti-cheat: right-click disable still applies; copy-paste disable applies.

