## 13. Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)

| Requirement | Implementation |
|---|---|
| Color contrast ≥ 4.5:1 (text) | `#0A0A0A` on `#FFFFFF` = 19.1:1 ✓; gold `#C9A84C` on black = 7.2:1 ✓ |
| Focus indicators | 3px offset gold ring `outline: 3px solid #C9A84C` on all interactive elements |
| Keyboard navigation | Full exam operable via keyboard (Tab to advance, Enter to select) |
| Screen reader | All timers have `role="timer"` + `aria-live="polite"`. Question stem has `role="heading"`. |
| Reduced motion | `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` disables all animations; timers still functional |
| Form labels | All inputs have visible labels + `aria-describedby` for error messages |
| Modal focus trap | Radix UI dialog handles focus trapping and aria-modal |
| Touch targets | Minimum 44×44px on all interactive elements (exam options: 60px tall) |

